oignant quest, from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ul5MlzXd35QQ7kNvwEXk-4y&_nc_oc=Adp523J_zX4qa2tEc-GqxgQXx1rBozyOnVDerBRBB7N-87XMRUfOCMMC9tOYk1nbpnQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af3RIzlPijBBqFcY88arYPGPSODL3jE9uB4xf4-gWQ1e6Q&oe=69F1E901"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HpNOeZi33jUQ7kNvwE9gdgm&_nc_oc=AdqXmyPnsA3QQYCav7tSF6CkhLKLXEwSUgiU4IOOxU5OIBfiWim5erqYATSg6Z9KZkM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af0wxA8L3d-VDj0GCHxNKEmvHD6NppLudAqjEzhBLaxhpw&oe=69F1F666"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AgccgzxejiQQ7kNvwHX1G-a&_nc_oc=AdoTJSTdRdoFynsTamA_eWYhYaHB5po5mQim8JB_C69cUn1-PswqfgVwypE9k_toCu0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af0SO64yXRGaRGsJ6kv6uc4uHphVJCtpJ5rE0NUIlENSCg&oe=69F2005C"}, {"file_name": "Bl